{{sacred}}{{/ˈseɪkrɪd}}{{adj. 神圣的；庄严的；宗教的}}{{The temple is a sacred place of worship.}}
{{sacrifice}}{{/ˈsækrɪfaɪs}}{{n./v. 牺牲；献祭；舍弃}}{{She sacrificed her career to raise her children.}}
{{sake}}{{/seɪk}}{{n. 缘故；目的；利益}}{{For the sake of safety, please wear a seatbelt.}}
{{salary}}{{/ˈsæləri}}{{n. 薪水；工资；薪金}}{{He receives a monthly salary of 10,000 yuan.}}
{{sample}}{{/ˈsɑːmpl}}{{n./v. 样品；取样；尝试；体验}}{{The company distributed free samples of the new product.}}
{{satellite}}{{/ˈsætəlaɪt}}{{n. 卫星；人造卫星；附属物}}{{The satellite orbits the earth at high speed.}}
{{satire}}{{/ˈsætaɪər}}{{n. 讽刺；讽刺文学；讽刺作品}}{{The novel is a satire on modern politics.}}
{{satisfy}}{{/ˈsætɪsfaɪ}}{{v. 使满意；满足；符合；消除}}{{The solution satisfied all parties involved.}}
