{{scan}}{{/skæn}}{{v./n. 扫描；浏览；审视；细看}}{{She scanned the document for errors.}}
{{scandal}}{{/ˈskændl}}{{n. 丑闻；耻辱；反感；流言蜚语}}{{The political scandal shocked the nation.}}
