{{screen}}{{/skriːn}}{{n. 屏幕；银幕；筛选；掩护}}{{The doctor screened patients for the disease.}}
{{scrutiny}}{{/ˈskruːtəni}}{{n. 仔细检查；详细审查；监视}}{{The company's finances came under scrutiny.}}
{{seal}}{{/siːl}}{{n./v. 印章；密封；海豹；封条}}{{Please seal the envelope before mailing it.}}
