{{sector}}{{/ˈsektər}}{{n. 部门；领域；扇形；防区}}{{The technology sector has grown rapidly.}}
{{secure}}{{/sɪˈkjʊər}}{{adj./v. 安全的；获得；保护；担保}}{{Make sure the windows are secure before leaving.}}
{{seek}}{{/siːk}}{{v. 寻求；追求；试图；请求}}{{She sought advice from her mentor.}}
