{{seize}}{{/siːz}}{{v. 抓住；夺取；没收；理解；侵袭}}{{The police seized illegal goods at the border.}}
{{select}}{{/sɪˈlekt}}{{v. 选择；挑选；选拔；精选的}}{{She selected the best candidate for the job.}}
