{{share}}{{/ʃeər}}{{v./n. 分享；份额；股票；分担}}{{She shared her experience with the group.}}
{{sharp}}{{/ʃɑːp}}{{adj. 锋利的；急剧的；敏锐的；鲜明的}}{{There was a sharp increase in prices.}}
