{{shine}}{{/ʃaɪn}}{{v./n. 发光；照耀；出色；擦亮}}{{The sun shone brightly in the sky.}}
{{shock}}{{/ʃɒk}}{{n./v. 震惊；冲击；休克；电击}}{{The news of the accident shocked everyone.}}
{{shore}}{{/ʃɔːr}}{{n. 岸；海滨；支柱；支撑}}{{They walked along the shore at sunset.}}
{{shortage}}{{/ˈʃɔːtɪdʒ}}{{n. 短缺；不足；缺乏}}{{There is a shortage of skilled workers in the industry.}}
