{{similar}}{{/ˈsɪmɪlər}}{{adj. 相似的；类似的；相同的}}{{The two proposals are very similar in nature.}}
{{simplify}}{{/ˈsɪmplɪfaɪ}}{{v. 简化；使简明；使单纯}}{{The new software simplifies the process.}}
