{{surface}}{{/ˈsɜːfɪs}}{{n. 表面；外表；地面；水面；外观}}{{The surface of the lake was calm and still.}}
{{surge}}{{/sɜːdʒ}}{{n./v. 激增；涌动；汹涌；电涌}}{{There was a surge in demand for online shopping.}}
{{surplus}}{{/ˈsɜːpləs}}{{n./adj. 剩余；过剩的；盈余；顺差}}{{The country has a trade surplus.}}
{{surrender}}{{/səˈrendər}}{{v./n. 投降；放弃；交出；自首}}{{The army surrendered after a long siege.}}
{{surround}}{{/səˈraʊnd}}{{v. 包围；围绕；环绕；环境}}{{The lake is surrounded by mountains.}}
{{survey}}{{/ˈsɜːveɪ}}{{n./v. 调查；测量；审视；概论；纵览}}{{The survey shows that most people support the plan.}}
{{survive}}{{/səˈvaɪv}}{{v. 幸存；存活下来；挺过；比…活得长}}{{Only a few passengers survived the crash.}}
{{suspect}}{{/səˈspekt}}{{v./n. 怀疑；嫌疑犯；可疑的；猜想}}{{The police suspected him of theft.}}
{{suspend}}{{/səˈspend}}{{v. 暂停；悬挂；延缓；停学；悬浮}}{{The school suspended the student for fighting.}}
{{sustain}}{{/səˈsteɪn}}{{v. 维持；承受；遭受；支撑；确认}}{{The company cannot sustain such heavy losses.}}
{{swallow}}{{/ˈswɒləʊ}}{{v./n. 吞；咽；燕子；忍受；轻信}}{{She swallowed the medicine with a glass of water.}}
{{swear}}{{/sweər}}{{v. 发誓；咒骂；宣誓；断言}}{{He swore to tell the truth in court.}}
{{sweep}}{{/swiːp}}{{v./n. 扫；席卷；范围；一连串；扫描}}{{The storm swept across the entire region.}}
{{swell}}{{/swel}}{{v./n. 膨胀；肿胀；增大；涌起；浪潮}}{{Her ankle swelled after the injury.}}
{{swift}}{{/swɪft}}{{adj. 迅速的；敏捷的；立刻的；突然的}}{{The government took swift action to address the crisis.}}
{{swing}}{{/swɪŋ}}{{v./n. 摇摆；秋千；转变；摆动；挥击}}{{The children were playing on the swings in the park.}}
{{switch}}{{/swɪtʃ}}{{v./n. 转换；开关；转变；替换}}{{She switched from teaching to writing.}}
{{symbol}}{{/ˈsɪmbl}}{{n. 象征；符号；标志；代号；记号}}{{The dove is a symbol of peace.}}
{{sympathy}}{{/ˈsɪmpəθi}}{{n. 同情；赞同；慰问；意气相投}}{{I have great sympathy for the victims of the disaster.}}
{{symptom}}{{/ˈsɪmptəm}}{{n. 症状；征兆；表现；迹象}}{{Fever is a common symptom of the flu.}}
{{syndrome}}{{/ˈsɪndrəʊm}}{{n. 综合征；典型表现；一组特征}}{{Doctors are studying the symptoms of this new syndrome.}}
{{system}}{{/ˈsɪstəm}}{{n. 系统；体制；制度；方法；身体}}{{The education system needs to be reformed.}}
